## ⛔ **THE `+` READS THE SIM'S MOST-USEFUL CREW, WHICH ALREADY COUNTS THE KEEPING** (reported from play:
## a Harvest under a Cultivate, crew 2, tending taking one whole worker, one idle worker — and the `+`
